ocuses on interpreted first-order logic, where the above-mentioned function and relation symbols have implicit semantics, which is not explicitly expressed via axioms within the logical framework. Typical applications include algebraic decision procedures and, more generally, quantifier elimination procedures, e.g., over the real numbers.\n  repository: https://github.com/logic1-eu/logic1\n\nextra:\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - lorenzleutgeb\n    - thomas-sturm\n",
